  "description": "Raw USB I/O extension for Periphery. Provides UsbDevice (one-shot open) and UsbDeviceProxy (reconnect-resilient) for claiming interfaces and running control / bulk transfers, on Windows via a native WinUSB backend and on Linux via libusb-1.0. (The macOS backend is planned — ADR-0038.)",
